\n  update_recent_topics.py: 2 calls\n  verify_artifacts.py: 5 calls (pre_write, pre_sync, post_sync, pre_drive, pre_wp)\n  sync_article_from_raw.py: 1 call\n  check_article.py: 1 call (after autofix)\n  update_manifest_step.sh: 5 calls\n  update_pick_status.py: 4 calls\n  switch_iteration.sh: 2 calls\n  build_creator_input.py: 1 call\n  save_google_drive_json.py: 1 call\n  aggregate_run_tokens.py: 1 call\n  build_and_send_card.py: 1 call\n  mark_feed_job.py: 1 call\n  dispatch_feed_jobs.py: 1 call\n  cleanup_run_artifacts.sh: 1 call\n\nTotal script executions: ~30+\n\n=== Exec Calls Count ===\nCounting exec invocations in this session...\n\n=== File I/O Patterns ===\n  manifest.json: written multiple times (Step 0.5, each step update)\n  recent_topics.json: written twice (researched, drafted)\n  Symlinks created/cleaned: 12 symlinks removed at end","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1785238364745}}
