{"type":"message","id":"c5cf1fcf","parentId":"0546048f","timestamp":"2026-07-28T11:34:06.432Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b31419b132250819","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat <<'EOF'\n=== SOUL.md STRUCTURAL IMPROVEMENTS ===\n\n## Current SOUL.md Issues\n\n**1. Explicit Script Calls as Instructions**\n- SOUL.md lists exact commands like `python3 script.py --arg1 --arg2`\n- Bloats the document (rereads every turn)\n- Hard to maintain (script changes = SOUL.md update)\n\n**Better Approach:**\n- SOUL.md describes WHAT to validate, not HOW\n- Scripts expose single entry point with stable interface\n- Example:\n  ```\n  # Bad (current):\n  python3 validate_research.py --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" --picks \"$RUN_DIR/picker/picks.json\" --pick-index $PICK_INDEX\n  \n  # Better:\n  python3 validate_step.py --step research\n  ```\n\n**2. Verbose Spawn Messages**\n- Each agent spawn includes long instructions\n- Template paths, research dump paths, constraints\n- ~500 tokens per spawn message\n\n**Solution: Agent SOUL.md Reference**\n```\nSpawn picker:\n  agentId: picker\n  task: |\n    INPUT: $RUN_DIR/picker/picker_input.json\n    OUTPUT: $RUN_DIR/picker/picks.json\n    MODE: classify-only\n    PROJECT: coinography\n```\n\nPicker's own SOUL.md has the full procedure.\nOrchestrator doesn't need to repeat it.\n\n**3. Conditional Logic in Prose**\n- FEED_DRAIN vs AUTO vs MANUAL paths described in prose\n- Easy to miss, hard to parse quickly\n\n**Solution: Decision Table**\n```markdown\n| Mode | Picker | Gate | Daily Cap |\n|------|--------|------|-----------|\n| FEED_DRAIN | classify-only (skip if N=1) | OFF | OFF |\n| AUTO | select | OFF | ON (4/day) |\n| MANUAL | select | ON | OFF |\n```\n\n**4. Error Handling is Verbose**\n- \"If PICKS_INVALID → retry (max 2) → stop\"\n- Repeated for every validation\n\n**Better: Standard Retry Pattern**\n```markdown\n## Validation Pattern\nEvery validate script outputs STATUS: PASS/FAIL.\nOn FAIL: retry step (max 2 retries, 3 total attempts).\nOn 3rd FAIL: mark pick failed, continue to next.\n```\n\n**5. Cleanup Instructions**\n- Step 3 has manual cleanup call\n- Should be automatic via `switch_iteration.sh --archive`\n\n---\n\n## Proposed SOUL.md Refactor\n\n```\n# SOUL.md — Nexus, Pipeline Orchestrator\n\n## Role\nSequence worker agents (picker, researcher, writer, creator).\nRun validation scripts. Collect outputs.\n\n## Entry → Mode → Flags\n| Entry | MODE | Picker | Gate | Cap |\n|-------|------|--------|------|-----|\n| FEED_DRAIN | classify-only | OFF | OFF |\n| AUTO_RUN | select | OFF | ON |\n| MANUAL | select | ON | OFF |\n\n## Steps (per story)\n1. Setup: init_run → export RUN_DIR\n2. Picker: spawn → validate → [PICKS_VALID: proceed]\n3. Research: spawn → validate_post_research → [TOPIC_FRESH: proceed]\n4. Write: spawn → validate_post_write → [ARTICLE_SYNCED: proceed]\n5. Image: spawn → [IMAGE_CREATED: proceed]\n6. Drive: upload → [DRIVE_LINK: proceed]\n7. WP: publish → card → [PUBLISHED: next story]\n\n## Validation\n- Each step has a single validation script\n- On FAIL: retry step (max 3 attempts)\n- On 3rd FAIL: mark failed, continue queue\n\n## Spawn Pattern\nspawn(agentId, {\n  run_dir: $RUN_DIR,\n  pick_index: $PICK_INDEX,\n  mode: \"classify-only\" | \"select\"\n})\n\nAgent SOUL.md has full procedure.\n```\n\n**Token Impact:**\n- Current: ~800 tokens/turn for SOUL.md\n- Proposed: ~200 tokens\n- **Savings: 75% reduction in context overhead**\n\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bedrock-mantle","model":"zai.glm-5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785238411837,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5705248f-88d6-41c4-8f96-ad7fd9cba566"}}
{"type":"message","id":"eef92d47","parentId":"c5cf1fcf","timestamp":"2026-07-28T11:34:06.713Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-b31419b132250819","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== SOUL.md STRUCTURAL IMPROVEMENTS ===\n\n## Current SOUL.md Issues\n\n**1. Explicit Script Calls as Instructions**\n- SOUL.md lists exact commands like `python3 script.py --arg1 --arg2`\n- Bloats the document (rereads every turn)\n- Hard to maintain (script changes = SOUL.md update)\n\n**Better Approach:**\n- SOUL.md describes WHAT to validate, not HOW\n- Scripts expose single entry point with stable interface\n- Example:\n  ```\n  # Bad (current):\n  python3 validate_research.py --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" --picks \"$RUN_DIR/picker/picks.json\" --pick-index $PICK_INDEX\n  \n  # Better:\n  python3 validate_step.py --step research\n  ```\n\n**2. Verbose Spawn Messages**\n- Each agent spawn includes long instructions\n- Template paths, research dump paths, constraints\n- ~500 tokens per spawn message\n\n**Solution: Agent SOUL.md Reference**\n```\nSpawn picker:\n  agentId: picker\n  task: |\n    INPUT: $RUN_DIR/picker/picker_input.json\n    OUTPUT: $RUN_DIR/picker/picks.json\n    MODE: classify-only\n    PROJECT: coinography\n```\n\nPicker's own SOUL.md has the full procedure.\nOrchestrator doesn't need to repeat it.\n\n**3. Conditional Logic in Prose**\n- FEED_DRAIN vs AUTO vs MANUAL paths described in prose\n- Easy to miss, hard to parse quickly\n\n**Solution: Decision Table**\n```markdown\n| Mode | Picker | Gate | Daily Cap |\n|------|--------|------|-----------|\n| FEED_DRAIN | classify-only (skip if N=1) | OFF | OFF |\n| AUTO | select | OFF | ON (4/day) |\n| MANUAL | select | ON | OFF |\n```\n\n**4. Error Handling is Verbose**\n- \"If PICKS_INVALID → retry (max 2) → stop\"\n- Repeated for every validation\n\n**Better: Standard Retry Pattern**\n```markdown\n## Validation Pattern\nEvery validate script outputs STATUS: PASS/FAIL.\nOn FAIL: retry step (max 2 retries, 3 total attempts).\nOn 3rd FAIL: mark pick failed, continue to next.\n```\n\n**5. Cleanup Instructions**\n- Step 3 has manual cleanup call\n- Should be automatic via `switch_iteration.sh --archive`\n\n---\n\n## Proposed SOUL.md Refactor\n\n```\n# SOUL.md — Nexus, Pipeline Orchestrator\n\n## Role\nSequence worker agents (picker, researcher, writer, creator).\nRun validation scripts. Collect outputs.\n\n## Entry → Mode → Flags\n| Entry | MODE | Picker | Gate | Cap |\n|-------|------|--------|------|-----|\n| FEED_DRAIN | classify-only | OFF | OFF |\n| AUTO_RUN | select | OFF | ON |\n| MANUAL | select | ON | OFF |\n\n## Steps (per story)\n1. Setup: init_run → export RUN_DIR\n2. Picker: spawn → validate → [PICKS_VALID: proceed]\n3. Research: spawn → validate_post_research → [TOPIC_FRESH: proceed]\n4. Write: spawn → validate_post_write → [ARTICLE_SYNCED: proceed]\n5. Image: spawn → [IMAGE_CREATED: proceed]\n6. Drive: upload → [DRIVE_LINK: proceed]\n7. WP: publish → card → [PUBLISHED: next story]\n\n## Validation\n- Each step has a single validation script\n- On FAIL: retry step (max 3 attempts)\n- On 3rd FAIL: mark failed, continue queue\n\n## Spawn Pattern\nspawn(agentId, {\n  run_dir: $RUN_DIR,\n  pick_index: $PICK_INDEX,\n  mode: \"classify-only\" | \"select\"\n})\n\nAgent SOUL.md has full procedure.\n```\n\n**Token Impact:**\n- Current: ~800 tokens/turn for SOUL.md\n- Proposed: ~200 tokens\n- **Savings: 75% reduction in context overhead**"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":156,"aggregated":"=== SOUL.md STRUCTURAL IMPROVEMENTS ===\n\n## Current SOUL.md Issues\n\n**1. Explicit Script Calls as Instructions**\n- SOUL.md lists exact commands like `python3 script.py --arg1 --arg2`\n- Bloats the document (rereads every turn)\n- Hard to maintain (script changes = SOUL.md update)\n\n**Better Approach:**\n- SOUL.md describes WHAT to validate, not HOW\n- Scripts expose single entry point with stable interface\n- Example:\n  ```\n  # Bad (current):\n  python3 validate_research.py --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" --picks \"$RUN_DIR/picker/picks.json\" --pick-index $PICK_INDEX\n  \n  # Better:\n  python3 validate_step.py --step research\n  ```\n\n**2. Verbose Spawn Messages**\n- Each agent spawn includes long instructions\n- Template paths, research dump paths, constraints\n- ~500 tokens per spawn message\n\n**Solution: Agent SOUL.md Reference**\n```\nSpawn picker:\n  agentId: picker\n  task: |\n    INPUT: $RUN_DIR/picker/picker_input.json\n    OUTPUT: $RUN_DIR/picker/picks.json\n    MODE: classify-only\n    PROJECT: coinography\n```\n\nPicker's own SOUL.md has the full procedure.\nOrchestrator doesn't need to repeat it.\n\n**3. Conditional Logic in Prose**\n- FEED_DRAIN vs AUTO vs MANUAL paths described in prose\n- Easy to miss, hard to parse quickly\n\n**Solution: Decision Table**\n```markdown\n| Mode | Picker | Gate | Daily Cap |\n|------|--------|------|-----------|\n| FEED_DRAIN | classify-only (skip if N=1) | OFF | OFF |\n| AUTO | select | OFF | ON (4/day) |\n| MANUAL | select | ON | OFF |\n```\n\n**4. Error Handling is Verbose**\n- \"If PICKS_INVALID → retry (max 2) → stop\"\n- Repeated for every validation\n\n**Better: Standard Retry Pattern**\n```markdown\n## Validation Pattern\nEvery validate script outputs STATUS: PASS/FAIL.\nOn FAIL: retry step (max 2 retries, 3 total attempts).\nOn 3rd FAIL: mark pick failed, continue to next.\n```\n\n**5. Cleanup Instructions**\n- Step 3 has manual cleanup call\n- Should be automatic via `switch_iteration.sh --archive`\n\n---\n\n## Proposed SOUL.md Refactor\n\n```\n# SOUL.md — Nexus, Pipeline Orchestrator\n\n## Role\nSequence worker agents (picker, researcher, writer, creator).\nRun validation scripts. Collect outputs.\n\n## Entry → Mode → Flags\n| Entry | MODE | Picker | Gate | Cap |\n|-------|------|--------|------|-----|\n| FEED_DRAIN | classify-only | OFF | OFF |\n| AUTO_RUN | select | OFF | ON |\n| MANUAL | select | ON | OFF |\n\n## Steps (per story)\n1. Setup: init_run → export RUN_DIR\n2. Picker: spawn → validate → [PICKS_VALID: proceed]\n3. Research: spawn → validate_post_research → [TOPIC_FRESH: proceed]\n4. Write: spawn → validate_post_write → [ARTICLE_SYNCED: proceed]\n5. Image: spawn → [IMAGE_CREATED: proceed]\n6. Drive: upload → [DRIVE_LINK: proceed]\n7. WP: publish → card → [PUBLISHED: next story]\n\n## Validation\n- Each step has a single validation script\n- On FAIL: retry step (max 3 attempts)\n- On 3rd FAIL: mark failed, continue queue\n\n## Spawn Pattern\nspawn(agentId, {\n  run_dir: $RUN_DIR,\n  pick_index: $PICK_INDEX,\n  mode: \"classify-only\" | \"select\"\n})\n\nAgent SOUL.md has full procedure.\n```\n\n**Token Impact:**\n- Current: ~800 tokens/turn for SOUL.md\n- Proposed: ~200 tokens\n- **Savings: 75% reduction in context overhead**","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1785238446713}}
{"type":"message","id":"fa7569c9","parentId":"eef92d47","timestamp":"2026-07-28T11:34:53.809Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-bac11295e2f50d2a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat <<'EOF'\n=== PRIORITY MATRIX ===\n\n| Change | Time Saved | Effort | Impact | Priority |\n|--------|-----------|--------|--------|----------|\n| Skip picker for FEED_DRAIN N=1 | 18s/story | Low | High | **P0** |\n| Batch verification scripts | 5s/story | Medium | High | **P0** |\n| Cache project config in init | 2-3s/story | Low | Medium | **P1** |\n| Merge manifest updates | 2-3s/story | Low | Medium | **P1** |\n| Combine post-research scripts | 3-4s/story | Medium | Medium | **P1** |\n| Reduce spawn message verbosity | Token savings | Low | Medium | **P2** |\n| Simplify SOUL.md | Context savings | Medium | Medium | **P2** |\n| Embed token tracking | 1s/story | Low | Low | **P2** |\n| Environment persistence | 0.5s/story | Low | Low | **P2** |\n| Remove legacy symlinks | Code cleanup | Low | Low | **P3** |\n\n---\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION ROADMAP ===\n\n## Phase 1: Quick Wins (This Week)\n\n### 1. Skip picker for FEED_DRAIN N=1\n**File:** `build_picker_input.py`\n**Changes:**\n- Detect FEED_DRAIN mode + N=1 + candidate_count=1\n- Write picks.json directly without spawning picker\n- Inject wp_category_ids from pool metadata\n\n**Implementation:**\n```python\n# In build_picker_input.py\nif args.feed_job_id and target_count == 1:\n    candidates = load_candidates()\n    if len(candidates) == 1:\n        # Fast path: write picks.json directly\n        write_picks_json(candidates[0], output_file)\n        print(f\"PICK_BYPASS: 1 candidate, writing picks.json directly\")\n        return\n# Otherwise, proceed with normal picker\n```\n\n**Time to implement:** 30 minutes\n**Savings:** 18 seconds per FEED_DRAIN story\n\n---\n\n### 2. Batch artifact verification\n**File:** `verify_artifacts.py`\n**Changes:**\n- Accept `--stages stage1,stage2,...` flag\n- Run all checks in one Python process\n- Return multi-line output\n\n**Implementation:**\n```python\n# verify_artifacts.py\nparser.add_argument(\"--stages\", default=\"all\")\nstages = args.stages.split(\",\") if args.stages != \"all\" else ALL_STAGES\n\nresults = []\nfor stage in stages:\n    ok = verify_stage(stage, manifest)\n    results.append(f\"ARTIFACTS_{ok}: {stage}\")\n    \nprint(\"\\n\".join(results))\n```\n\n**Orchestration change:**\n```bash\n# Before: 5 separate calls\nverify_artifacts.py --stage pre_write\nverify_artifacts.py --stage pre_sync\n...\n\n# After: 1 call\nverify_artifacts.py --stages pre_write,pre_sync,post_sync,pre_drive,pre_wp\n```\n\n**Time to implement:** 1 hour\n**Savings:** 4 exec calls (~5 seconds) per story\n\n---\n\n### 3. Cache project config in init_run.sh\n**File:** `init_run.sh`\n**Changes:**\n- Read ALL fields from project_config.py once\n- Export everything to env file\n- Never re-query during run\n\n**Implementation:**\n```bash\n# init_run.sh\nCONFIG_JSON=$(python3 project_config.py --slug \"$PROJECT_SLUG\" --all --json)\nexport DRIVE_PREFIX=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.publisher.drive_doc_prefix')\nexport DRIVE_PARENT=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.publisher.drive_parent_id')\nexport DRIVE_ACCOUNT=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.publisher.drive_account')\nexport GROUP_CHAT_ID=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.telegram.group_id')\nexport TEMPLATE_PATH=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.writer.template_path')\n```\n\n**Time to implement:** 30 minutes\n**Savings:** 5 Python calls (~2-3 seconds) per story\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Structural Improvements (Next Week)\n\n### 4. Combine post-research scripts\n**New file:** `post_research_pipeline.py`\n**Merges:**\n- validate_research.py\n- check_recent_topic_duplicates.py\n- update_recent_topics.py\n- verify_artifacts.py (pre_write)\n- update_manifest_step.sh (research)\n- update_pick_status.py (writing)\n\n**Interface:**\n```bash\npython3 post_research_pipeline.py \\\n  --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" \\\n  --pick-index $PICK_INDEX\n```\n\n**Output:**\n```\nRESEARCH_VALID: <headline>\nTOPIC_FRESH: no match\nTOPIC_REGISTRY_UPDATED: <run_id>\nARTIFACTS_OK: pre_write\nMANIFEST_UPDATED: research succeeded\nPICK_STATUS: writing\nPOST_RESEARCH_PASS\n```\n\n**Time to implement:** 2 hours\n**Savings:** 3-4 exec calls per story\n\n---\n\n### 5. Simplify spawn messages\n**Current:** 500+ tokens per spawn\n**Target:** 100 tokens\n\n**Approach:**\n- Agent SOUL.md has full procedure\n- Orchestrator only passes: RUN_DIR, PICK_INDEX, MODE\n- Agent reads manifest for other context\n\n**Example:**\n```\n# Before (writer spawn):\nPROJECT_CONFIG: /home/bhard/.openclaw/projects/coinography.json\nPROJECT_SLUG: coinography\nTEMPLATE_PATH: /home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-writer/templates/COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md\n<research_dump>/tmp/.../validated.json</research_dump>\n... (verbose instructions)\n\n# After:\nRUN_DIR: /tmp/coinography-run-...\nPICK_INDEX: 1\nMODE: write\nPROJECT_SLUG: coinography\n```\n\nWriter's SOUL.md: \"Read RUN_DIR/research/validated.json, write to RUN_DIR/article/raw.md, etc.\"\n\n**Time to implement:** 1 hour per agent SOUL.md\n**Savings:** ~400 tokens per agent spawn (1600 tokens per story)\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: SOUL.md Refactor (When Stable)\n\n### 6. Compress orchestrator SOUL.md\n**Target:** 200 lines (down from ~500)\n**Approach:**\n- Decision tables instead of prose\n- Script handles details\n- Only encode: sequence, flags, retry pattern\n\n**Time to implement:** 2-3 hours\n\n---\n\n=== TOTAL PROJECTED IMPACT ===\n\n**Current performance:**\n- 8 minutes per FEED_DRAIN story\n- ~30 script executions\n- ~800 tokens of orchestrator SOUL.md per turn\n- ~1600 tokens in spawn messages\n\n**After Phase 1+2:**\n- 6-7 minutes per story (15-20% faster)\n- ~15 script executions (50% reduction)\n- ~400 tokens spawn messages (75% reduction)\n- Same token context, faster cycles\n\n**Bottleneck after optimization:**\n- Agent reasoning time (writer: 92s, creator: 73s)\n- These are harder to speed up (model architecture)\n- But we've removed all orchestrator friction\n\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bedrock-mantle","model":"zai.glm-5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785238446715,"responseId":"chatcmpl-71f36a66-311e-429e-89cd-5c41f67bb1e5"}}
