LINE_MANIFEST\" \\\n  --pick-index $PICK_INDEX\n```\n\n**Output:**\n```\nRESEARCH_VALID: <headline>\nTOPIC_FRESH: no match\nTOPIC_REGISTRY_UPDATED: <run_id>\nARTIFACTS_OK: pre_write\nMANIFEST_UPDATED: research succeeded\nPICK_STATUS: writing\nPOST_RESEARCH_PASS\n```\n\n**Time to implement:** 2 hours\n**Savings:** 3-4 exec calls per story\n\n---\n\n### 5. Simplify spawn messages\n**Current:** 500+ tokens per spawn\n**Target:** 100 tokens\n\n**Approach:**\n- Agent SOUL.md has full procedure\n- Orchestrator only passes: RUN_DIR, PICK_INDEX, MODE\n- Agent reads manifest for other context\n\n**Example:**\n```\n# Before (writer spawn):\nPROJECT_CONFIG: /home/bhard/.openclaw/projects/coinography.json\nPROJECT_SLUG: coinography\nTEMPLATE_PATH: /home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-writer/templates/COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md\n<research_dump>/tmp/.../validated.json</research_dump>\n... (verbose instructions)\n\n# After:\nRUN_DIR: /tmp/coinography-run-...\nPICK_INDEX: 1\nMODE: write\nPROJECT_SLUG: coinography\n```\n\nWriter's SOUL.md: \"Read RUN_DIR/research/validated.json, write to RUN_DIR/article/raw.md, etc.\"\n\n**Time to implement:** 1 hour per agent SOUL.md\n**Savings:** ~400 tokens per agent spawn (1600 tokens per story)\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: SOUL.md Refactor (When Stable)\n\n### 6. Compress orchestrator SOUL.md\n**Target:** 200 lines (down from ~500)\n**Approach:**\n- Decision tables instead of prose\n- Script handles details\n- Only encode: sequence, flags, retry pattern\n\n**Time to implement:** 2-3 hours\n\n---\n\n=== TOTAL PROJECTED IMPACT ===\n\n**Current performance:**\n- 8 minutes per FEED_DRAIN story\n- ~30 script executions\n- ~800 tokens of orchestrator SOUL.md per turn\n- ~1600 tokens in spawn messages\n\n**After Phase 1+2:**\n- 6-7 minutes per story (15-20% faster)\n- ~15 script executions (50% reduction)\n- ~400 tokens spawn messages (75% reduction)\n- Same token context, faster cycles\n\n**Bottleneck after optimization:**\n- Agent reasoning time (writer: 92s, creator: 73s)\n- These are harder to speed up (model architecture)\n- But we've removed all orchestrator friction"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":335,"aggregated":"=== PRIORITY MATRIX ===\n\n| Change | Time Saved | Effort | Impact | Priority |\n|--------|-----------|--------|--------|----------|\n| Skip picker for FEED_DRAIN N=1 | 18s/story | Low | High | **P0** |\n| Batch verification scripts | 5s/story | Medium | High | **P0** |\n| Cache project config in init | 2-3s/story | Low | Medium | **P1** |\n| Merge manifest updates | 2-3s/story | Low | Medium | **P1** |\n| Combine post-research scripts | 3-4s/story | Medium | Medium | **P1** |\n| Reduce spawn message verbosity | Token savings | Low | Medium | **P2** |\n| Simplify SOUL.md | Context savings | Medium | Medium | **P2** |\n| Embed token tracking | 1s/story | Low | Low | **P2** |\n| Environment persistence | 0.5s/story | Low | Low | **P2** |\n| Remove legacy symlinks | Code cleanup | Low | Low | **P3** |\n\n---\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION ROADMAP ===\n\n## Phase 1: Quick Wins (This Week)\n\n### 1. Skip picker for FEED_DRAIN N=1\n**File:** `build_picker_input.py`\n**Changes:**\n- Detect FEED_DRAIN mode + N=1 + candidate_count=1\n- Write picks.json directly without spawning picker\n- Inject wp_category_ids from pool metadata\n\n**Implementation:**\n```python\n# In build_picker_input.py\nif args.feed_job_id and target_count == 1:\n    candidates = load_candidates()\n    if len(candidates) == 1:\n        # Fast path: write picks.json directly\n        write_picks_json(candidates[0], output_file)\n        print(f\"PICK_BYPASS: 1 candidate, writing picks.json directly\")\n        return\n# Otherwise, proceed with normal picker\n```\n\n**Time to implement:** 30 minutes\n**Savings:** 18 seconds per FEED_DRAIN story\n\n---\n\n### 2. Batch artifact verification\n**File:** `verify_artifacts.py`\n**Changes:**\n- Accept `--stages stage1,stage2,...` flag\n- Run all checks in one Python process\n- Return multi-line output\n\n**Implementation:**\n```python\n# verify_artifacts.py\nparser.add_argument(\"--stages\", default=\"all\")\nstages = args.stages.split(\",\") if args.stages != \"all\" else ALL_STAGES\n\nresults = []\nfor stage in stages:\n    ok = verify_stage(stage, manifest)\n    results.append(f\"ARTIFACTS_{ok}: {stage}\")\n    \nprint(\"\\n\".join(results))\n```\n\n**Orchestration change:**\n```bash\n# Before: 5 separate calls\nverify_artifacts.py --stage pre_write\nverify_artifacts.py --stage pre_sync\n...\n\n# After: 1 call\nverify_artifacts.py --stages pre_write,pre_sync,post_sync,pre_drive,pre_wp\n```\n\n**Time to implement:** 1 hour\n**Savings:** 4 exec calls (~5 seconds) per story\n\n---\n\n### 3. Cache project config in init_run.sh\n**File:** `init_run.sh`\n**Changes:**\n- Read ALL fields from project_config.py once\n- Export everything to env file\n- Never re-query during run\n\n**Implementation:**\n```bash\n# init_run.sh\nCONFIG_JSON=$(python3 project_config.py --slug \"$PROJECT_SLUG\" --all --json)\nexport DRIVE_PREFIX=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.publisher.drive_doc_prefix')\nexport DRIVE_PARENT=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.publisher.drive_parent_id')\nexport DRIVE_ACCOUNT=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.publisher.drive_account')\nexport GROUP_CHAT_ID=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.telegram.group_id')\nexport TEMPLATE_PATH=$(echo \"$CONFIG_JSON\" | jq -r '.writer.template_path')\n```\n\n**Time to implement:** 30 minutes\n**Savings:** 5 Python calls (~2-3 seconds) per story\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Structural Improvements (Next Week)\n\n### 4. Combine post-research scripts\n**New file:** `post_research_pipeline.py`\n**Merges:**\n- validate_research.py\n- check_recent_topic_duplicates.py\n- update_recent_topics.py\n- verify_artifacts.py (pre_write)\n- update_manifest_step.sh (research)\n- update_pick_status.py (writing)\n\n**Interface:**\n```bash\npython3 post_research_pipeline.py \\\n  --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" \\\n  --pick-index $PICK_INDEX\n```\n\n**Output:**\n```\nRESEARCH_VALID: <headline>\nTOPIC_FRESH: no match\nTOPIC_REGISTRY_UPDATED: <run_id>\nARTIFACTS_OK: pre_write\nMANIFEST_UPDATED: research succeeded\nPICK_STATUS: writing\nPOST_RESEARCH_PASS\n```\n\n**Time to implement:** 2 hours\n**Savings:** 3-4 exec calls per story\n\n---\n\n### 5. Simplify spawn messages\n**Current:** 500+ tokens per spawn\n**Target:** 100 tokens\n\n**Approach:**\n- Agent SOUL.md has full procedure\n- Orchestrator only passes: RUN_DIR, PICK_INDEX, MODE\n- Agent reads manifest for other context\n\n**Example:**\n```\n# Before (writer spawn):\nPROJECT_CONFIG: /home/bhard/.openclaw/projects/coinography.json\nPROJECT_SLUG: coinography\nTEMPLATE_PATH: /home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-writer/templates/COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md\n<research_dump>/tmp/.../validated.json</research_dump>\n... (verbose instructions)\n\n# After:\nRUN_DIR: /tmp/coinography-run-...\nPICK_INDEX: 1\nMODE: write\nPROJECT_SLUG: coinography\n```\n\nWriter's SOUL.md: \"Read RUN_DIR/research/validated.json, write to RUN_DIR/article/raw.md, etc.\"\n\n**Time to implement:** 1 hour per agent SOUL.md\n**Savings:** ~400 tokens per agent spawn (1600 tokens per story)\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: SOUL.md Refactor (When Stable)\n\n### 6. Compress orchestrator SOUL.md\n**Target:** 200 lines (down from ~500)\n**Approach:**\n- Decision tables instead of prose\n- Script handles details\n- Only encode: sequence, flags, retry pattern\n\n**Time to implement:** 2-3 hours\n\n---\n\n=== TOTAL PROJECTED IMPACT ===\n\n**Current performance:**\n- 8 minutes per FEED_DRAIN story\n- ~30 script executions\n- ~800 tokens of orchestrator SOUL.md per turn\n- ~1600 tokens in spawn messages\n\n**After Phase 1+2:**\n- 6-7 minutes per story (15-20% faster)\n- ~15 script executions (50% reduction)\n- ~400 tokens spawn messages (75% reduction)\n- Same token context, faster cycles\n\n**Bottleneck after optimization:**\n- Agent reasoning time (writer: 92s, creator: 73s)\n- These are harder to speed up (model architecture)\n- But we've removed all orchestrator friction","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1785238494254}}
{"type":"message","id":"3f193b51","parentId":"18a369d8","timestamp":"2026-07-28T11:35:04.800Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-89009db18faaf17a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat <<'EOF'\n=== FINAL SUMMARY ===\n\n## What Worked Well\n\n1. **Clean separation of concerns** - Orchestrator delegates to agents, doesn't do reasoning\n2. **Validation gates** - Caught issues early (e.g., topic duplicates)\n3. **Manifest-driven state** - Every step recorded, debugging is easy\n4. **Group routing** - FEED_DRAIN correctly used group context from init, not from inbound message\n5. **Token aggregation** - Tracking even when free models used\n\n## Top 3 Friction Points (by time impact)\n\n| Rank | Issue | Time Lost |\n|------|-------|-----------|\n| 1 | Picker spawn for N=1 FEED_DRAIN | 18s |\n| 2 | 5x verify_artifacts calls | 5s |\n| 3 | 5x project_config.py calls | 2-3s |\n\n**Total friction:** ~25-30 seconds per story (could be eliminated)\n\n## Recommended Implementation Order\n\n**This week:**\n1. ✅ Skip picker in build_picker_input.py (FEED_DRAIN N=1 fast-path)\n2. ✅ Batch verify_artifacts.py (--stages flag)\n3. ✅ Cache all config in init_run.sh\n\n**Next week:**\n4. ✅ Combine post-research scripts into one\n5. ✅ Simplify agent spawn messages\n\n**When stable:**\n6. ✅ Compress SOUL.md (decision tables, remove script details)\n\n## Other Observations\n\n**The pipeline is fundamentally SOUND:**\n- 8 minutes for a full article (research→write→image→publish) is reasonable\n- The agent reasoning time (writer 92s, creator 73s) is the floor\n- Optimizations target orchestrator overhead, not agent logic\n\n**Where to focus NEXT:**\n- Writer quality improvements (see editorial_feedback patterns)\n- Image prompt variety (creator scene hints)\n- Auto-retry patterns (current manual spawn retry works well)\n\n**NOT worth optimizing:**\n- Environment sourcing (0.5s, lots of edge cases)\n- Legacy symlinks (works, doesn't slow anything)\n- Token tracking (already negligible)\n\n## One Final Suggestion\n\nConsider adding a **pipeline health dashboard**:\n- Track: stories/hour, avg time per step, retry rates\n- Show: bottlenecks, most common failures\n- Alert: when retry rate >20%, or research validation <80%\n\nThis would give visibility into whether optimizations are working.\n\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bedrock-mantle","model":"zai.glm-5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785238494256,"responseId":"chatcmpl-885adf68-0336-40b2-ad27-7708c5244fa6"}}
