{"type":"message","id":"878f4667","parentId":"471f51e5","timestamp":"2026-07-28T11:41:18.066Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-accd9795c5abcc7b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat <<'EOF'\n=== COMPOUND EXECUTION OPPORTUNITIES ===\n\n## Turn Combination Analysis\n\n### Batch 1: Picker Setup (Turns 1-9)\n\n**Current (9 turns):**\n1. exec: claim feed job\n2. exec: init_run.sh\n3. exec: persist batch metadata\n4. exec: build_picker_input.py\n5. spawn: picker\n6-7. yield: wait\n8. exec: validate_picks.py\n9. exec: update_pick_status + switch_iteration\n\n**Optimized (4 turns):**\n```bash\n# Turn 1: Combined startup\nsource /tmp/coinography-run-env.sh 2>/dev/null || \\\n  bash init_run.sh \"coinography\" && source /tmp/coinography-run-env.sh\npython3 -c \"\nimport editorial_db as db, json\njob = db.claim_next_feed_job('coinography')\nprint(json.dumps(job._asdict() if job else None))\n\" | tee /tmp/feed_job.json\npython3 update_manifest_batch.py --target 1\npython3 build_picker_input.py --feed-job-id $(jq .id /tmp/feed_job.json) ...\n\"\n\n# Turn 2: spawn picker\nsessions_spawn(agentId=\"picker\", task=\"...\")\n\n# Turn 3: yield\nsessions_yield()\n\n# Turn 4: Post-picker combined\npython3 post_picker_pipeline.py --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\"\n```\n\n**Savings: 9 → 4 turns (5 turns saved)**\n\n---\n\n### Batch 2: Post-Research Validation (Turns 13-17)\n\n**Current (5 turns):**\n13. exec: validate_research.py\n14. exec: check_recent_topic_duplicates.py\n15. exec: update_recent_topics.py --researched\n16. exec: verify_artifacts.py --pre_write\n17. exec: update_manifest_step + update_pick_status\n\n**Optimized (1 turn):**\n```bash\npython3 post_research_pipeline.py \\\n  --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" \\\n  --picks \"$RUN_DIR/picker/picks.json\" \\\n  --pick-index 1\n# Internally runs: validate, topic_check, update_registry, verify, manifest_update\n```\n\n**Savings: 5 → 1 turn (4 turns saved)**\n\n---\n\n### Batch 3: Post-Write Validation (Turns 21-25)\n\n**Current (5 turns):**\n21. exec: verify_artifacts.py --pre_sync\n22. exec: sync_article_from_raw.py\n23. exec: autofix + check_article\n24. exec: verify_artifacts.py --post_sync\n25. exec: update_manifest_step --write\n\n**Optimized (1 turn):**\n```bash\npython3 post_write_pipeline.py \\\n  --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" \\\n  --article \"$RUN_DIR/article/raw.md\"\n# Internally: verify, sync, autofix, check, verify, manifest_update\n```\n\n**Savings: 5 → 1 turn (4 turns saved)**\n\n---\n\n### Batch 4: Drive Upload Sequence (Turns 31-34)\n\n**Current (4 turns):**\n31. exec: pandoc + docx build\n32. exec: verify_artifacts.py --pre_drive\n33. exec: gog drive upload\n34. exec: save_google_drive_json + update_manifest\n\n**Optimized (1 turn):**\n```bash\npandoc \"$RUN_DIR/article/final.md\" -o \"$RUN_DIR/article/article.docx\" && \\\npython3 verify_artifacts.py --stage pre_drive --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" && \\\nDRIVE_JSON=$(gog drive upload ...) && \\\npython3 save_google_drive_json.py --json \"$DRIVE_JSON\" --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" && \\\npython3 update_manifest_step.sh --step drive --status succeeded\n```\n\n**Savings: 4 → 1 turn (3 turns saved)**\n\n---\n\n### Batch 5: WordPress Publish Sequence (Turns 35-41)\n\n**Current (7 turns):**\n35. exec: verify_artifacts.py --pre_wp\n36. exec: publish.sh\n37. exec: update_recent_topics --drafted + manifest\n38. exec: aggregate_run_tokens.py\n39. exec: build_and_send_card.py\n40. exec: update_pick_status --published\n41. exec: switch_iteration --archive\n\n**Optimized (1 turn):**\n```bash\npython3 verify_artifacts.py --stage pre_wp --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" && \\\nbash publish.sh --status draft --project coinography ... && \\\npython3 post_wp_pipeline.py --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" --pick-id 199\n# Internally: update_topics, aggregate_tokens, send_card, update_pick, archive_iteration\n```\n\n**Savings: 7 → 1 turn (6 turns saved)**\n\n---\n\n### Batch 6: Cleanup (Turns 42-44)\n\n**Current (3 turns):**\n42. exec: batch report\n43. exec: cleanup_run_artifacts.sh\n44. exec: mark_feed_job + dispatch\n\n**Optimized (1 turn):**\n```bash\npython3 finalize_run.py --manifest \"$PIPELINE_MANIFEST\" --feed-job-id 102\n# Internally: report, cleanup, mark_job, dispatch_next\n```\n\n**Savings: 3 → 1 turn (2 turns saved)**\n\n---\n\n## TOTAL TURN REDUCTION\n\n| Batch | Current Turns | Optimized Turns | Saved |\n|-------|---------------|-----------------|-------|\n| Picker setup | 9 | 4 | 5 |\n| Post-research | 5 | 1 | 4 |\n| Post-write | 5 | 1 | 4 |\n| Drive upload | 4 | 1 | 3 |\n| WP publish | 7 | 1 | 6 |\n| Cleanup | 3 | 1 | 2 |\n| **TOTAL** | **33 exec turns** | **9 exec turns** | **24 turns** |\n\n**Agent spawn/yield turns remain unchanged:** 12 turns (necessary for async execution)\n\n## OPTIMIZED TURN COUNT\n\n| Category | Current | Optimized |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|\n| Exec turns | 33 | 9 |\n| Spawn/yield turns | 12 | 12 |\n| **Total** | **45** | **21** |\n\n**Total reduction: 24 turns (53% fewer)**\n\nEOF"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bedrock-mantle","model":"zai.glm-5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785238857599,"responseId":"chatcmpl-701990a1-7919-4d43-abf7-555d82054604"}}
